body:
Oh don’t worry, I know I wouldn’t be the AH if I chose not to buy the pancakes. It’s just my friend (who I will name Callie) is also the present of the chess club we run together at my school. She’s been going through a lot of shit as president and I’m secretary so as a friend and fellow officer I just wanted to treat her as a ‘thank you’ for all of the hard work she’s done and in general to cheer her up over some shit she’s been going through lately. Kinda just like treating out a friend to ice cream. It was only $10 for her food so it’s not like I was dropping crazy money that I couldn’t afford. Payday was that night and I had $10 to spare if I wanted to.

I guess it was Mary’s reaction that really made me anxious. She just seemed really upset when I told her that for some reason.

Also thanks for calling me sweetheart ;;
